NecroLog is a medical technology manufacturer with heavy ties to the [[Org/Pale Lantern Society/index|Pale Lantern Society]].

On its face NecroLog makes medical machinery and supplies. Through the [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Ghosts]] it is known that the business is a front for moving medicinal and illegal reagents in and out of cities and across borders, the stock for building alchemical bombs. [[People/Donnie|Donovan Hale]] has a contact in NecroLog he leans on about the new firearms from [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]].

NecroLog held a berth aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]. On the night of the second tithe its fane went fallow and its holding was gone; whether its people died or moved in with another power is not known.
